			<div class="content" id="post-content-2834560">
									

<p>Antimemetics Division knew that something associated with the cognitohazardous files in the 2111 registry was trying to communicate with them, as documented in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2111/offset/2">RIDDEN TONGUE</a>, and Wheeler apparently grew to trust the warnings before the end. &quot;In The Trenches with the Dead&quot; is going to go more into this.</p>
<p>There may be members of the 05 that know about both AD and CD and may have read both RIDDEN TONGUE and REVENANT THEORY.</p>
<p>It also isn't just 2111 they seem to be worried about, but also the 05 resurrecting them by any means.</p>
<p>These seem to be very high placed, very experienced Foundation super spooks (no pun intended) so they seem to know enough to be worried that you can't ever retire from the Foundation, not even by dying. Which has probably already happened to them since they apparently started at the Foundation 114 years ago!</p>

